<div class="container">
	<div class="columns">
		<div class="fullwidth_column">
			<div id="post-11" class="post_box grt top">
				<div class="headline_area">
					<h1 class="headline">Plan Your Visit to Aurora Maize</h1>
				</div>
				<div class="post_content">
<blockquote class="green">
<p style="text-align: center;"><strong>Open: Sept 19 &#8211; Oct 31, 2026<br />
</strong><strong>Wednesdays start on Oct 7, 2026<br />
Opening Day starts at 4pm</strong><br />
<strong>Hours: Wednesdays 5pm &#8211; 8:30pm | Fridays 5pm &#8211; 10pm | Saturdays 4pm &#8211; 10pm<br />
Last admission at posted closing times</strong>.<br />
<strong> Closed: Sundays, Mondays, Tuesdays &amp; Thursdays</strong></p>
</blockquote>
<a href="https://www.strideevents.com/events/aurora-maize/2026/tickets" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><img decoding="async" class="noB alignright wp-image-75 size-full" style="padding-right: 150px;" src="https://auroramaize.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/09/buyTickets.png" alt="" width="272" height="137" /></a>
<p>All-inclusive admission pass options for ages 4 to 104:</p>
<ul>
<li><strong>Maze Pass</strong><br />
Maze w/unlimited Courtyard Activities<br />
$14.00</li>
</ul>
<ul>
<li><strong><img fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" class="noB alignright wp-image-1531 size-full" src="https://auroramaize.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/fall2026.Calendar.webp" alt="" width="600" height="400" srcset="https://auroramaize.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/fall2026.Calendar.webp 600w, https://auroramaize.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/fall2026.Calendar-300x200.webp 300w" sizes="(max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px" />Zombie Harvest Pass</strong><br />
$15.00 Friday or Saturday (Starts at dusk)<br />
Includes 100 paintballs; buy extra 50 rounds for $5.00</li>
<li><strong>Maze/Zombie Harvest Combo</strong><br />
Friday or Saturday with unlimited Courtyard Activities (Zombie Harvest starts at dusk)<br />
$25.00</li>
<li><strong>Courtyard Activities only</strong><br />
Includes: Hayride, Jumping Pillow, Boxer Jocks, Twin Spin, Mechanical Bull, corn box, farm animals, movies, Cow Train, and more.<br />
Does not include maze admission.<br />
$8.00</li>
<li><strong>Rent a Bonfire Site</strong><br />
This includes getting the fire started for you, providing wood and roasting sticks (if you need them)<br />
$12.00 per hour  |  <a href="/group-reservations/">Make a Reservation</a></li>
</ul>
<p style="text-align: center;">Children ages 3 and under are always free. Any member of the U.S. Military is admitted free with valid ID. Note that we offer special group rates for schools, church groups, and/or civic organizations &#8212; <a href="/group-reservations/">by reservation only</a>.</p>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
	<div class="footer">
		<div class="text_box foot_textBox">
			Aurora Maize: 20591 County Rd. 2200 | Aurora, MO  65605 <br />Phone: 417-489-1220 | Hotline: 417-236-6714
		</div>
